{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-2024016","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-2024016-handbook-monster-2024016-0","text":"由「建木」化生，拱卫其根系的灵瑞之兽，履迹所之，和泽滋生，枝杪郁敷。\n自毁于太古时代的战争后，「建木」终于在星核的修补下再度生长。彼时仙人们所造的珍禽奇兽纷至沓来，宛如旧梦重临。","speaker":""}]}
